---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Me"
  description="The personal and professional journey of Rasika Rathnayake."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Personal journey</p>
      <h1>About me</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        Every scientific career has a personal story behind it. Mine has been
        shaped by curiosity, education, adaptation, and the determination to
        keep moving forward.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>My story, one chapter at a time</h2>

        <p>
          This page will document the experiences, people, challenges, and
          opportunities that shaped my journey from early life to doctoral
          research.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <span class="tag">Chapter 01</span>
          <h3>Early life and curiosity</h3>

          <p>
            My early experiences established the curiosity, values, and
            persistence that would later guide my interest in science and
            education.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <span class="tag">Chapter 02</span>
          <h3>Finding my path in science</h3>

          <p>
            Education transformed curiosity into direction and introduced me
            to the questions, methods, and possibilities of scientific
            research.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <span class="tag">Chapter 03</span>
          <h3>My doctoral journey</h3>

          <p>
            Today, I am a PhD candidate at the University at Buffalo,
            developing as an independent scientist through research,
            collaboration, teaching, and continuous learning.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Beyond the laboratory</p>
      <h2>The person behind the research</h2>

      <p>
        My life is broader than academic titles and research results. I am also
        interested in education, scientific communication, travel, meaningful
        conversations, and sharing experiences that may help others.
      </p>

      <p>
        This section will gradually grow into a detailed life story containing
        important milestones, photographs, memories, and reflections.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>